message: "If you use OpenCADIrrigation in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenCADIrrigation"
abstract: "Free, open-source web application for designing pressurised irrigation systems: a CAD with a hydraulic engine that lays out the network, sizes the pipes by linear programming, checks pressures, uniformity and transients, and produces the bill of materials and reports, with an optional AI assistant."
authors:
  - name: "OpenCADIrrigation contributors"
version: "1.6.0"
date-released: "2026-11-02"
license: MIT
url: "https://opencadirrigation.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/videjunior/opencadirrigation"
keywords:
  - irrigation design
  - drip irrigation
  - sprinkler irrigation
  - centre pivot
  - hydraulic network
  - pipe sizing
  - CAD
